# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D(2S)+ l- nu, D(2S)+ -> D+ eta] gap mode (resonant)
# NickName: B0_D1_2550lnu_Deta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_1(2550)+ [= D(2S)+ in EvtGen, PDG 100411, m=2564 MeV, w=135 MeV]
#   -> D+ eta, isospin partner of decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/D1_2550Deta (D(2S)0 -> D0 eta;
#   arXiv:2605.03021). Generated by the full-isospin generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff
#   pipeline. CAVEAT: evt.pdl for this release explicitly annotates "D(2550)+ has not been
#   observed" -- D(2S)+ exists in the particle DB only as the isospin-symmetric partner of the
#   observed D(2S)0 (same mass/width by construction, PDG code 100411), not as an independently
#   measured state. Using it here assumes exact isospin symmetry, consistent with the premise of
#   this generalization, but flag this explicitly since it is a genuinely unobserved state.
#   ISGW2 for B -> D(2S) l nu; PHSP for D(2S) -> D eta sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias D1_2550sig D(2S)+
Alias anti-D1_2550sig D(2S)-
ChargeConj D1_2550sig anti-D1_2550sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D1_2550sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS ISGW2;
0.500 D1_2550sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D1_2550sig
1.0   D+  eta   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1_2550sig

End
